      "result": "Implemented the persistent URL shortener API with PostgreSQL storage, Alembic migrations, and click tracking. `start.sh` applies migrations and starts the server on `0.0.0.0:8000`; the README explains how to run it.\n\nVerified the main HTTP behaviors, including link creation, duplicate and unknown-code errors, redirects with one click increment, ordering, and invalid requests. Also confirmed migrations can be applied again safely and `start.sh` is executable. The temporary test links were removed from the database.",
